    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Apr 2024 09:33:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春天不是读书天！春天是春心满园，春意撩人，</span><strong><span>春心萌动！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我要如何不爱上你，当我望向你的眼，在这不停重复俗气又沉重的春天~~~~~~</span></p><span></span><p><span>没想到围绕crush已有太多陈词滥调，我们竟然还能聊得如此起劲，吐露如此多心声，咂摸出新鲜之词，~~</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>crush是见色起意吗？还是一场“投射”？</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>这场迷恋究竟是寂寞，还是命中注定？</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>精神出轨与肉体出轨，哪个你更能接受？</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>为什么我对“异性恋浪漫氛围”过敏！</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>yixue，沉迷于爱情幻觉的清醒恋爱脑，📖：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c5ed33e000000001b000e84?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b62f584e8ac2b73abd53cba&amp;apptime=1711961634" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c5ed33e000000001b000e84?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b62f584e8ac2b73abd53cba&amp;apptime=1711961634"><span>@浓汤雪宝</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>斯怡，表面工作狂背地里在crush来crush去，📖：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bb1f08374391300011de771?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b62f584e8ac2b73abd53cba&amp;apptime=1711961696" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bb1f08374391300011de771?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b62f584e8ac2b73abd53cba&amp;apptime=1711961696"><span>@斯怡Jins</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🫧🫧</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">03:32</a> 斯怡crush乌龙：crush是一场错误的见色起意！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="561">09:21</a> yixue : 所有的crush、喜欢、移情，都是在追求爱的梦幻泡影！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> crush是气味吗？还是一种色彩，一段对话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="974">16:14</a> yixue的爱：《我们曾在高朋满座中讲隐晦爱意说到尽兴！》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1471">24:31</a> 关于“背德”：精神出轨与肉体出轨，哪一个你更不能接受？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2236">37:16</a> "假正经人"斯怡：我不会crush氛围感，我只会爱......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2764">46:04</a> 也许crush并不是一个性缘限定词！爱的定义是否太过贫瘠？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3535">58:55</a>crush下头！为何我们退烧了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4132">1:08:52</a> 斯怡：crush是我对抗这个越来越糟糕世界的一种方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4710">1:18:30</a> 你也会crush朋友吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5163">1:26:03</a> “新年快乐”最浪漫的回答是——</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵</span></p><span></span><p><span>私奔——曾轶可</span></p><span></span><p><span>三的颜色——曾轶可</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎬</span></p><span></span><p><span>《穆德家的一夜》侯麦</span></p>]]></description>
