  <item>
    <title>32.东亚女宝，勇闯天涯！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66054e301519139e4f29bf8a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66054e301519139e4f29bf8a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Mar 2024 11:02:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期聊点咱东亚女宝勇闯天涯的故事。可有口是我在互联网上结识的朋友，在全世界环游，目标是走遍五大洲七大洋。她在社交媒体上写如何香港做咖啡师学徒，在日本滑雪店做义工，旅途中遇到的故事，和浪漫的人。同时，我们也对彼此身上的“东亚性”问题展开了一些讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这是一期充满勇气的节目~~~大家听得开心！</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：Qko，xhs：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/596367f86a6a6922cddeb38a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b62f584e8ac2b73abd53cba&amp;apptime=1711559473" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/596367f86a6a6922cddeb38a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b62f584e8ac2b73abd53cba&amp;apptime=1711559473"><span>@我妈说我是妖女</span></a><span>，写点咱东亚女宝勇闯天涯的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>shownote:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 日本滑雪店“艳遇”，与异国帅哥大亲亲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 天上飘下来的鹅毛大雪也无法将其浇灭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1046">17:26</a> 行走世界，你是Cindy、Amy、Miranda？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1558">25:58</a> GenZ的“亚逼”，妈妈的“妖女”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2368">39:28</a> 东亚女宝，与东亚家庭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> 纹身与恐错，我总觉得自己属于未来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4455">1:14:15</a> 在跨国体验中，感受东亚性的隐痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5017">1:23:37</a> 我用什么填满你？我的欲望奖赏桶？</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm:</span></p><span></span><p><span>关灯——祁紫檀</span></p><span></span><p><span>生活在别处——陈婧霏</span></p>]]></description>
