uid=63daf0c50000000026004875&amp;apptime=1708942549" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b62f584e8ac2b73abd53cba?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=63daf0c50000000026004875&amp;apptime=1708942549"><span>@飞行学习中</span></a><span>，播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61e1c77d19e8465da2f8f717" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61e1c77d19e8465da2f8f717"><span>【气泡Bubble】</span></a><span>，下马威第31期</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d1d034f50b650b28459dbe" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d1d034f50b650b28459dbe"><span>《找个地方随便活一下》</span></a><span>嘉宾）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>💬 时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>《GenZ性别议题探索指南》全球震撼发布，各界小咖送来祝福</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 记者采访环节，斯怡和CC介绍自己</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> 这份指南能够诞生，TA们功不可没！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="957">15:57</a> 为什么要把AI和性别议题结合？斯怡竟然还做过这些新新探索</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 斯怡的性别意识启蒙，以及对国内性别传播专业的失望</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">31:35</a> 产品揭秘之《指南》的设计逻辑、板块划分、收录标准</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2416">40:16</a> 斯怡本人最爱的板块是？真的有女性主义网文吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2567">42:47</a> 技术，你打不倒人文！只是“为我的原创性生活服务”！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> “Z世代神话”是否会娱乐化女性主义议题？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3339">55:39</a> “信息差”的底层思维不该是金字塔，而是万花筒</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3499">58:19</a> 咱们Z世代女性喜欢或需要怎样的工具跟内容？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4381">1:13:01</a> 《指南》创作过程中斯怡与创作者们的连结，</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Bdoze5WgY75HxqYQnNG3_w" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Bdoze5WgY75HxqYQnNG3_w"><span>一封古典而真挚的感谢信</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>*感谢在发布会中发来祝福的朋友：猫猫朋克、小毛、予警、乌乌、绒</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>🎨本期封面</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>斯怡用AI画的《小极客和小巫师》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>🎶 音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>片尾曲 Les Fleur-Minnie Ripperton</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>🎬提及的人物及作品</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>波伏娃</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>海德格尔</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>春夏</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>贾玲</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>沈眉庄</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>电影《相助》-泰特·泰勒</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>网文《零诺》-行烟烟（以及她上</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b49a87b6aa15ef2c30b93a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b49a87b6aa15ef2c30b93a"><span>展开讲讲的节目</span></a><span>）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>剧集《亢奋》-萨姆·莱文森</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>剧集《飞天小女警》-克雷格·麦克科雷肯</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://gamma.app/docs/AIGC-Dev-9y7n4vslcp2bol2" data-url="https://gamma.app/docs/AIGC-Dev-9y7n4vslcp2bol2"><span>《AIGC时代个人生存/摸鱼探索指南》</span></a><span>-余一Dev</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>网站《精選主題: 奇怪捏．世代差異 - 第 1 頁 | DQ 地球圖輯隊 (yam.com)》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
